  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add rice, water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6346b0cd952a64d25c0884e7/step-4b6d3ba2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice carrot and roughly chop capsicum.\n• Cut tofu into 2cm cubes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6346b0cd952a64d25c0884e7/step-0c0d5ad0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook carrot and capsicum until tender, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil and cook tofu until browned, 3-4 mins. Transfer to the veggie bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6346b0cd952a64d25c0884e7/step-cdf28ecc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add curry paste (see ingredients) and remaining garlic to frying pan and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in coconut milk, water (for the curry), soy sauce, the brown sugar and cooked veggies and tofu and simmer until thickened, 4 mins.\n• Divide garlic rice and tofu curry between bowls.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6346b0cd952a64d25c0884e7/step-346773fd.jpg"
    }
  ]
